  "question": "Which two numbers should be interchanged to make the given equation correct?\n\n63 - 45 + 14 + (81 ÷ 9) × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114\n\n(Note: Interchange should be done of the entire number and not individual digits of a given number.)",
