  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 63 - 45 + 14 + (81 ÷ 9) × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 4 and 3\n\n63 - 45 + 14 + (81 ÷ 9) × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114 ⇒ 63 - 45 + 14 + (81 ÷ 9) × 3 + 18 × 4 = 114\n\n⇒ 63 - 45 + 14 + __**(81 ÷ 9)**__ × 3 + 18 × 4 = 114\n\n⇒ 63 - 45 + 14 + __**9 × 3**__ + __**18 × 4**__ = 114\n\n⇒ __**63 + 14 + 27 + 72**__ - 45 = 114\n\n⇒ __176** - 45**__ = 114\n\n⇒ 131 ≠ 114 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 14 and 18\n\n63 - 45 + 14 + (81 ÷ 9) × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114 ⇒ 63 - 45 + 18 + (81 ÷ 9) × 4 + 14 × 3 = 114\n\n⇒ 63 - 45 + 18 + __**(81 ÷ 9)**__ × 4 + 14 × 3 = 114\n\n⇒ 63 - 45 + 18 + __**9 × 4**__ + __**14 × 3**__ = 114\n\n⇒ __**63 + 18 + 36 + 42**__ - 45 = 114\n\n⇒ __159** - 45**__ = 114\n\n⇒ 114 = 114 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) 45 and 81\n\n63 - 45 + 14 + (81 ÷ 9) × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114 ⇒ 63 - 81 + 14 + (45 ÷ 9) × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114\n\n⇒ 63 - 81 + 14 + __**(45 ÷ 9)**__ × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114\n\n⇒ 63 - 81 + 14 + __**5 × 4**__ + __**18 × 3**__ = 114\n\n⇒ __**63 + 14 + 20 + 54**__ - 81 = 114\n\n⇒ __151** - 81**__ = 114\n\n⇒ 70 ≠ 114 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 63 and 81\n\n63 - 45 + 14 + (81 ÷ 9) × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114 ⇒ 81 - 45 + 14 + (63 ÷ 9) × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114\n\n⇒ 81 - 45 + 14 + __**(63 ÷ 9)**__ × 4 + 18 × 3 = 114\n\n⇒ 81 - 45 + 14 + __**7 × 4**__ + __**18 × 3**__ = 114\n\n⇒ __**81 + 14 + 28 + 54**__ - 45 = 114\n\n⇒ __177** - 45**__ = 114\n\n⇒ 132 ≠ 114 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
